OL,3,GNEWSA'Firestarters do not understand
OL,4,Aimpact on farm'
OL,5,
OL,6,FPeople who started a fire which ravaged
OL,7,F40 acres (16 hectares) of farmland
OL,8,Fshould be educated on the consequences
OL,9,Fof their actions, a farmer has said.
OL,11,FThe blaze, on Flinton Hill Farm, near
OL,12,FSunderland, on Sunday destroyed about
OL,13,F#8,000-worth of straw, according to
OL,14,Ffarmer, Tania Tallon.
OL,16,FTallon said she believed the fire,
OL,17,Fwhich saw "months of work" go up in
OL,18,Fsmoke, had been started by children.
OL,19,FShe said the farm witnessed anti-social
OL,20,Fbehaviour every week.
OL,23,APub: 18-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
