OL,3,GNEWSA'Firestarters do not understand
OL,4,Aimpact on farm'
OL,5,
OL,6,FTyne and Wear Fire Rescue Service
OL,7,F(TWFRS) said seven fire appliances had
OL,8,Fbeen involved in extinguishing the
OL,9,Fblaze. Northumbria Police said it was
OL,10,Finvestigating.
